    "Name": "Peregrine (Kurita)",
    "Details": "Built for Wolf’s Dragoons by the Baclkwell Corporation, the Peregrine was later made available to interested buyers across the Inner Sphere. Quickly relegated to rear line and policing duties due to its poor armor and short range weapons, the Peregrine was rarely seen in front line combat. Powered by a 220 rated Fusion Engine, the Peregrine (Kurita) is protected by a meagre 0.5 tons of armor; and armed with paired Medium Lasers and SRM-4s.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 12/18 hexes / 360/540 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>        10     15\n<b>Left</b>          10     15\n<b>Right</b>        10     15\n<b>Rear</b>          5     15\n\n<b>Total</b>       40     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Breaching Shot</color>",
